bio-mcp queries and redistributes derived aggregates from third-party
public data sources, each under its own terms:

- CZ CELLxGENE Census (Chan Zuckerberg Initiative) —
  https://cellxgene.cziscience.com/  (data under CC-BY 4.0)
- BioGRID ORCS (BioGRID / Mount Sinai) —
  https://orcs.thebiogrid.org/  (requires a free access key; academic use)
- NCBI Gene (gene_info) — https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/gene/  (public domain)

Attribute these sources when using bio-mcp output in published work.
